Project: Job Matcher

Architecture:
Client
→ FastAPI
→ AI Service
→ Gemini
→ CVProfile
→ PostgreSQL

Jobs:
Airtable
→ Import/ETL
→ PostgreSQL
→ FastAPI
→ Redis

Important rules:
- Environment configuration is handled only by app/core/config.py
- AI integrations belong under app/services/ai/
- API endpoints should not contain business logic
- Database access belongs in repositories
- Business logic belongs in services
- Do not expose API keys